quran[27]{c,v,t}:
  55,41,The guilty shall be recognised by their mark and seized by (their) forelocks and feet.
  55,42,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,43,(They will be told:) ‘This is the Hell which the guilty deny.’
  55,44,They shall go around between its flames and scalding water.
  55,45,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,46,"The one who fears standing before his Lord, there will be two Gardens for him."
  55,47,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,48,Both will be full of lush green branches.
  55,49,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,50,"In both of them, there will be two flowing springs."
  55,51,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,52,"In both of them, there will be two kinds of every fruit."
  55,53,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,54,"(The residents of Paradise will be) reclining upon couches lined with silky green brocade, and the fruits of two Gardens will hang low (over them)."
  55,55,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,56,"In them, there will be those (chaste maidens) with modest gazes whom no human has ever touched before, nor jinn."
  55,57,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,58,Those (maidens) will be (beautiful and elegant) like rubies and corals.
  55,59,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,60,Can the reward of goodness be anything but goodness?
  55,61,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,62,"Besides these two, there will be two (other) gardens."
  55,63,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,64,Both (will be) dark green.
  55,65,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
  55,66,"In both of them, there will be two gushing springs."
  55,67,Then which of your Lord’s blessings do you both deny?
